<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">One feedback file and one index line. The format rule is saved there: Ubuntu bash first, Python as a one-line side note, no project templates unless asked.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The memory lives outside the workspace, so the workspace has no memory folder.</p></td></tr>
